meta {
  name: Update Settings
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/settings
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "values": {
      "MAX_ROWS": "5000",
      "APP_NAME": "D-Pilot",
      "AZURE_OPENAI_KEY": ""
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Save one or more settings; they apply without a restart. Each value is validated by kind (whole number, URL, boolean, JSON array, duration…) — the first invalid one is a 400 and nothing is written. An empty secret keeps the stored one. Changing `QUERY_TIMEOUT_MS` closes all pools; changing `SCHEMA_CACHE_TTL_HOURS` clears the schema cache. Audited as `SETTINGS_UPDATE` (key names only). Returns the same list as List Settings.

  Requires a valid Bearer JWT ({{token}}).
  **Admin only.**
}
